@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Overall student exam lifecycle. Sources: Student_Desktop_App (LoginViewModel, Core/DeviceFingerprint,
' Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy, ViewModels/DashboardViewModel (ConfirmAttendanceAsync, StartExamAsync),
' Services/ApiClient (api/exams/student/start), Views/ExamWindow, Services/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator,
' Services/LiveMonitoringService), Backend_API (AuthController.StudentLogin, ExamsController.StartExam
' [POST api/exams/student/start], SaveAnswer, Submit, MonitoringController, SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync,
' Services/Grading/*, SessionTimeoutService, GradingController accept-ai, ExamsController answers/{id}/override).
' Sized for includegraphics width 1.0 linewidth (about 7.1 pt printed). Large font + low dpi: PlantUML's gaps are fixed in pixels, so a large font raises the text-to-space ratio.
' Printed size = fontSize * 72 * W_in / png_width_px (independent of dpi).
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 32
skinparam ArrowFontSize 32
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 33
}

|Student|
start
:Enter email or roll
no. + password;
|Desktop App|
:v2 fingerprint (BIOS,
disk, baseboard), POST
auth/student-login;
|Server|
if (Password, role, device hash
OK? (else 401 UNAUTHORIZED,
FORBIDDEN, DEVICE_MISMATCH)) then (no)
  stop
else (yes: JWT +\nrefresh token)
endif
|Desktop App|
repeat
:7 checks: Network, ClockSkew,
ScreenCapture, Camera, Micro-
phone, SecureMode, Disk; POST
exams/{id}/readiness;
repeat while (Required check
failed and exam
requires it?) is (yes)
-> no;
|Student|
:Check in, then
click Start;
|Desktop App|
:POST monitoring/event
(Attendance), then POST
exams/student/start;
|Server|
if (Eligible, open, not already
submitted, seat OK, readiness
fresh if required? (else e.g.
NOT_ELIGIBLE, SEAT_MISMATCH,
EXAM_NOT_STARTED,
ALREADY_SUBMITTED,
READINESS_REQUIRED)) then (no)
  stop
else (yes: ExamSession\nInProgress or resumed)
endif
fork
  |Student|
  :Answer MCQ,
  theory, code;
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  :Lockdown on, save-
  answer, heartbeat 10 s,
  event batches, captures,
  YuNet + YOLOX-Nano;
  |Server|
  :Store, push to
  MonitoringHub;
end fork
-> submit, timer 0 (auto),\nforce-submit or timeout;
:FinalizeAsync: lock session,
SHA-256 receipt; if AI evaluation
on, grade MCQ + theory (TF-IDF),
queue code; winnowing if not practice;
|Desktop App|
:Release lockdown,
verify receipt after submit
or auto-submit, or show
Exam Ended after force-
submit or timeout;
|Server|
:In the background, GradingWorker
runs queued code tests in Docker
gcc:13 or MinGW fallback;
|Teacher|
:Accept AI marks via
grading/accept-ai, or
override via
answers/{id}/override;
stop
@enduml
